<section id="outreach" class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-space-blue-dark/30">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Outreach & Public Engagement</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300">
        Bringing astrophysics to people - from children under desert skies to families in Barcelona parks.
      </p>
    </div>

    <article class="bg-space-blue-dark/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-space-blue-light/20">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Magnet Alliance at ICE-CSIC</h2>
        <span class="px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-space-orange/20 border border-space-orange/40 text-space-orange-light text-sm font-semibold">2022 – 2024</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
        Member of the Magnet Alliance outreach programme at the Institute of Space Sciences (ICE-CSIC), Barcelona. The Magnet programme, led by Fundacio Bofill, fights school segregation in Catalonia by connecting research institutes with under-resourced public schools. I contributed as an outreach researcher working alongside teachers and students at Gabriel Castella i Raich school in Igualada.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 p-5 rounded-xl border border-space-blue-light/30 bg-space-blue-light/10">
        <p class="text-space-blue-light text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold mb-2">ICE-CSIC Featured Event</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-3">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Astronomy for Sahrawi Children: Amanar Project, Castelldefels</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-300">August 25, 2023</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-200 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Co-organised an astronomy outreach session for Sahrawi children visiting Spain through the "Vacaciones en Paz" programme, in collaboration with the Castelldefels Astronomical Group (Astrofels). Activities included a Solar System cosmic walk (Earth = peppercorn scale), followed by telescope observation of the Moon and Saturn. Attended by 12 children and their host families.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="https://www.ice.csic.es/news/outreach-initiatives?view=article&id=379&catid=8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-space-orange-light hover:text-space-blue-light transition-colors font-medium">Read the ICE-CSIC feature →</a>
          <a href="https://www.ice.csic.es/news/outreach-initiatives?view=article&id=594&catid=2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-space-orange-light hover:text-space-blue-light transition-colors font-medium">Magnet Initiative page →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

